{
"start": 104.0,
"end": 118.0,
"text": "And now he comes up to the Italian ambassador about their problem, where they have a lot of gas that just goes away, because the Rams always interested in the gas.",
"conf": -0.54,
"no_speech": 0.51
},
{
"start": 118.0,
"end": 128.0,
"text": "And France had said, look, France talks to the king about whether they could get goods together like the firm did for El Paso.",
"conf": -0.54,
"no_speech": 0.51
},
{
"start": 128.0,
"end": 135.0,
"text": "Then the king came back with a different feedback. The king came back with an indication for a time.",
"conf": -0.56,
"no_speech": 0.76
},
{
"start": 135.0,
"end": 138.0,
"text": "Any time between October 15th and 22nd.",
"conf": -0.56,
"no_speech": 0.76
},
{
"start": 138.0,
"end": 143.0,
"text": "That's why there's so many pictures that you can't go inside.",
