{
"start": 171.0,
"end": 184.4,
"text": "But an old friend of ours, who has been in the road all the time, a gas driver, and several other people that I don't know at all, have all called saying that, you know, these Jews who have been screaming about Sophie's Jews and stuff.",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.24
},
{
"start": 184.4,
"end": 191.8,
"text": "And half of them really mean that someone has to say it to them. And so don't, you know, don't take it for granted.",
"conf": -0.52,
"no_speech": 0.24
},
{
"start": 194.2,
"end": 198.6,
"text": "Oh, pass them. But he meant that Max Fisher is doing something he's looking to do or something.",
